sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant D as Dashboard
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant PG as PostgreSQL read model
    participant KG as Neo4j
    participant EX as feed.events

    U->>D: Open local POC dashboard
    D->>A: GET /predictions
    A->>PG: Read approved schemas/views
    PG-->>A: Predictions and outcomes
    A-->>D: Paginated response using canonical asset IDs
    D->>A: GET /graph/assets/GOLD
    A->>KG: Read graph projection
    KG-->>A: Relevant nodes and edges
    A-->>D: Graph response

    Note over A,D: Live updates use Gateway-specific queues
    EX->>A: gateway.predictions.live
    A-->>D: prediction update
    EX->>A: gateway.scored.live
    A-->>D: score update

